incident=Gondi NFT-lending "Purchase Bundler" drain, 2026-03-09 (~$230K, ~78 NFTs / ~40 txs, Ethereum mainnet). A recently shipped Purchase Bundler exposed a buy entry point with NO msg.sender restriction; the bundled execution moved NFTs without checking the caller's relation to them, so the attacker named victims' IDLE NFTs and the bundler pulled them with the victims' lingering setApprovalForAll operator grant. Attacker EOA 0x8d171c74c85cd2ec9f38143dd5d8a7c89df47051; bundler 0xe95e3cfc4939d6d98dbda31aafe950c3ee84d73c; example tx 0x83bac5d4b222b97f9734637c072589da648941b8a884ce1a61324dc0449e6a06, block 24618641.
